{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54336","headline":"云居月 · 克符道者","name":"云居月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素容空界外，廓落迥无边。\n玉镜同千域，金轮匝五天。\n霜凝熊耳印，冰浩鹫峯玄。\n不是龙居月，难光洞上泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"克符道者","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}